The dance clip this scene plays is dance1_subject2 from Ubisoft La Forge's Animation
Dataset ("LAFAN1", https://github.com/ubisoft/ubisoft-laforge-animation-dataset), whose
README states:

    "This dataset can be used under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-
     NoDerivatives 4.0 International Public License (see license.txt)."

The clip is its retargeting to the Unitree G1 from the LAFAN1 Retargeting Dataset
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/lvhaidong/LAFAN1_Retargeting_Dataset), as
unitree_rl_mjlab ships it. The license's terms are at

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/legalcode

It permits sharing for noncommercial purposes only, unmodified and with credit.
